translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_9af00f01:

    l "Y-"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_da755a8c:

    l "滚开,不然我他妈的 把你踩成一堆没用的龙纸浆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_b9bcf94a:

