translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_02_19dcc86a:

    "你决定感谢他 趁他没发现之前溜走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_03_d8fcb5c2:

    l "我以前见过这样的作战装备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_03_83fa63b9:

